  Magnetretrieve - Robot Firmware
  ESP32 + 1x L298N + 4 DC motors + 180-degree servo arm + electromagnet + metal sensor
  Control over Wi-Fi (HTTP) and Bluetooth Low Energy (BLE).

  ---------------------------------------------------------------------
  WIRING (default pins, change them in the config block)
    L298N : IN1=26  IN2=27  ENA=25   (LEFT  motors: front-left + rear-left in parallel on OUT1/OUT2)
